Always use the specific instruction that come with the Images you want to install! <p>If there are none and you are provided with a boot image (likely named boot.img) and a root image (likely named root.img, rootfs.img or userdata.img), you can try these generic instructions: Flash the boot image: <pre><code>fastboot flash boot_ab &lt;boot image&gt;
</code></pre> Flash the rootfs image: <pre><code>fastboot flash userdata &lt;root image&gt;
</code></pre> Clear the dtbo partition: <pre><code>fastboot erase dtbo 
</code></pre> Exit fastboot and reboot: <pre><code>fastboot reboot
</code></pre></p>
